# Direct documentation-site dependencies.
#
# Zensical is the successor to MkDocs + Material for MkDocs, by the same team.
# It reads the existing `mkdocs.yml` unchanged. Material for MkDocs reaches end
# of life on 2026-11-05, and MkDocs 2.0 drops the plugin and theming systems it
# depends on with no migration path.
zensical
